// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`frozen S3 reports > render the exploratory ones exactly as before > 报告 v2.md 1`] = `"<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-slot="badge" data-variant="secondary" class="h-5 gap-1 rounded-4xl border border-transparent px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium transition-all has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3! inline-flex items-center justify-center w-fit whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive overflow-hidden group/badge bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground [a]:hover:bg-secondary/80">探索性</span><span data-slot="badge" data-variant="outline" class="h-5 gap-1 rounded-4xl border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium transition-all has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3! inline-flex items-center justify-center w-fit whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive overflow-hidden group/badge border-border text-foreground [a]:hover:bg-muted [a]:hover:text-muted-foreground">已交付 · 引用已自检</span></div><div class="@container"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 @3xl:flex-row @3xl:items-start"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h1 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">买方采购逻辑 调查报告 v2</h1><blockquote class="border-border text-muted-foreground border-l-2 pl-3 text-sm leading-7">在系统跑出的 <span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>报告 v1</span> 基础上打磨（AI 起草，等结论审批）：结论先行、每条 so what 都挂证据、改正了 v1 里一条读反的反证和一处没展开的证据编号。<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">四条判断与 v1 相同，都是&quot;需要修正&quot;</strong>，打磨没有改动团队判断标准下的结论。</blockquote><section class="bg-muted/40 flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg px-4 py-3"><h2 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Summary</h2><ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要回答的问题：有统一机队管理的大中型企业，会不会把&quot;可管的员工端侧个人 AI&quot;当作采购的必要条件？如果会，钱从哪个预算科目出——软件席位、安全与管理服务，还是硬件的 AI 溢价？它支撑的决策是：联想明年在商用个人 AI 上，差异化押在管理 / 安全栈、端侧算力，还是自研 agent。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground"><strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">一句话答案</strong>：<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">&quot;管得住&quot;是入场券，不是加价理由。</strong> IT 仍然握着员工端 AI 进不进机队的准入权，安全治理在实打实地推迟和收窄部署；但没有证据说明企业愿意为 AI 能力多付硬件钱，软件和服务这一侧也只证明了&quot;怎么计费&quot;，没证明&quot;钱落在哪个科目、由谁出&quot;。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground"><strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">So what（按对决策的影响排序）</strong>：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground"><strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">押端侧算力，买方这一侧撑不住。</strong> 企业买 AI PC 是跟着换机顺带买的，把 AI 当首要采购条件的客户极少：&quot;It would be an incredibly niche set of customers whose first priority [would be] AI capabi…&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[ComputerWeekly 2025-10 Omdia称Win11才是换机主因#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button>；2025 年企业采购的主要推手是 Windows 10 停服：&quot;The impending end of support (EOS) for Windows 10 in October 2025 was the primary catalyst…&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Futurum 2025-12 AI PC采用不会加速#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>。→ <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">对联想</strong>：明年商用 AI PC 不能把&quot;AI / NPU&quot;当加价理由去谈，溢价叙事在采购桌上会被拆穿。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground"><strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">管理 / 安全栈是保份额的门票，要做成能写进采购资格条款的证明物。</strong> 安全是 CIO 扩大 AI 的头号障碍：&quot;Indeed, 77% of more than 11,000 CIOs in Gartner&#x27;s 1H26 CIO Report said security and risk w…&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[InformationWeek 2026-06 安全在拖慢自主AI#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>；并且已经变成缩减部署的实际结果：&quot;It also found that 81.6% had deployed AI in a reduced form because of security concerns, i…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Enterprise AI deployments slowed by security reviews#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button>。→ <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">对联想</strong>：把集中部署、日志导出、策略下发、审计追溯做成可以逐条对上采购条款的能力清单，用它守住机队份额；<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">不要指望它单独带来溢价</strong>（推断：现有证据只看到&quot;拖慢、缩减&quot;，没看到&quot;为它多付钱&quot;）。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground"><strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">变现路径要先验证：AI 的钱可能不在 IT 手里。</strong> 有二手报道称多数企业 AI 支出由业务部门审批：&quot;Eighty percent of enterprise AI spend is now approved and managed at the business unit lev…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[BCG Finds 80 Percent of Enterprise AI Spending Happens Outsi#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>；券商的 CIO 调查也说预算在往软件倾斜、AI 的钱越来越来自 IT 之外：&quot;that reallocates spending toward Software and away from Hardware and Communications, and AI funding increasingly coming from&quot;（C 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Investing.com 2026-01 摩根士丹利CIO调查AI未抬高IT预算#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button>。→ <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">对联想</strong>：如果只对 IT 卖&quot;管理栈&quot;，能守住准入，但可能碰不到 AI 的增量预算。这条证据只有 C 级，<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">是本报告最需要专家访谈确认的一点</strong>。</li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground"><strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">调查得到的结果</strong>（都是提议，等人拍板）：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">H1 选型权在 IT → <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">需要修正</strong>（提议）：IT 握的是&quot;准入权&quot;，不是&quot;全部采购发起权&quot;</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">H2 可管理性是必要条件 → <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">需要修正</strong>（提议）：是推迟和收窄部署的主要原因，但&quot;一票否决&quot;只见到个例</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">H3 钱在软件 / 服务科目 → <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">需要修正</strong>（提议）：硬件侧&quot;AI 不单独定价&quot;成立；软件 / 服务侧科目归属没证</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">H4 只批可证明价值 → <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">需要修正</strong>（提议）：&quot;AI 标签拉不动预算&quot;成立；&quot;必须先证明回报才批&quot;有正反两面</li></ul></li></ul><ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground"><strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">和高层指示的关系</strong>：高层要求&quot;重点看 IT 能不能管&quot;：&quot;重点看 IT 能不能管&quot;<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[2026-10-16 高层周会（模拟）#^m1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^m1</span></button>。本次的回答是：<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">能不能管，决定能不能进门；不决定能不能多收钱。</strong></li></ul></section><h2 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">怎么查的</h2><ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">这次调查的出发点（系统按计划的 derived_from / relates_to 和它们指向的 workplan、项目、假设写出，不是模型写的）：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">会议“2026-10-16 高层周会（模拟）”：<span class="border-primary/40 text-muted-foreground border-l-2 pl-1.5 italic">我先插一句，方向先别飘。重点看 IT 能不能管。为什么？第一，我们卖给企业的东西，决定权在 CIO 和 IT 手里，不在员工手里。员工想要什么，最后要 IT 点头才能进公司。</span>（来自 workplan v2）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[20_项目/个人AI战略/会议/2026-10-16 高层周会（模拟）#^m1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^m1</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">会议“2026-10-16 高层周会（模拟）”：<span class="border-primary/40 text-muted-foreground border-l-2 pl-1.5 italic">Senior：嗯，我理解大概三层。第一层，能不能集中部署和配置——IT 能不能推下去、统一策略、远程改，不是一台一台员工自己弄。</span>（来自 workplan v2）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[20_项目/个人AI战略/会议/2026-10-16 高层周会（模拟）#^m3]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^m3</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">决定“W1决定-员工个人AI按受控agent定义并把供需缺口交给W2”（来自 workplan v2）：<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>W1决定-员工个人AI按受控agent定义并把供需缺口交给W2</span></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">决定“W1决定-AI PC渗透不作为付费意愿证据”（来自 workplan v2）：<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>W1决定-AI PC渗透不作为付费意愿证据</span></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">项目“项目”（来自 调查计划）：<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>项目</span></li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">调查计划：<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>计划 v1</span>（来自 <span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>workplan v2</span> 的 next action；G1 已通过，不是探索性）。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">系统执行：完整调查，先查知识库再联网；联网搜索 17 次、抓取 34 次，用时约 18 分钟；知识库资料 21 条、网络资料 30 条（网络资料标&quot;网络 · AI 定级&quot;）。每个论点都专门跑了一轮反证检索。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">系统自检：v1 的引用自检 107 处全部通过，但有一处证据编号没有展开成引用，所以 v1 停在草稿没有交付。v2 已改正。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">v2 相对 v1 的改动：①结论先行，加了一句话答案和三条带证据的 so what；②改正 H4 里一条读反的反证（见 H4 一节）；③不再使用一条定级有误的来源（一档播客被系统按域名定成 A 级，本报告不把它当证据）；④每个论点只保留最关键的证据，完整证据列表见 v1。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">计划之外的调整：本轮排不了专家访谈，缺口都转成文末&quot;要问专家&quot;的问题。</li></ul><h2 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">逐个假设</h2><h3 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-3 text-base font-semibold">H1 员工端侧个人 AI 的选型权在 IT / CIO 手里　<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>WS-A-H1 选型权在IT不在员工</span></h3><ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">提议的判断：需要修正</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">修正后的假设：在有统一机队管理的大中型企业里，员工端 AI 工具<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">进不进机队</strong>（接 SSO、归集日志、接受策略下发）仍由 IT 决定；影子 AI 主要是员工在&quot;使用&quot;层面绕过政策。但 AI 订阅和 API 这类支出，存在业务部门绕过正式采购的情形，此时 IT 只剩事后发现和收编，而不是事先选型。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">支持的证据：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">厂商把机队管理平台卖给 CIO，说明&quot;进机队&quot;是 IT 的事：&quot;Our WXP platform helps CIOs track and manage fleets of connected devices and applications.&quot;（A 级，知识库，厂商立场）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[HP 2026-08 FY26Q3 财报电话会#^c5]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c5</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">员工绕过的是公司已有的政策，规则仍由企业定：&quot;According to the findings, two-thirds of office professionals report having used AI tools …&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[PagerDuty 2026-06 影子AI调查#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>；另一家、另一批样本结论相近：&quot;In a new BlackFog survey, nearly half (49%) of workers admit to adopting AI tools without …&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[CIO.com 2026-01 BlackFog影子AI调查#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button></li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">反证：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">团队用公司卡买模型 API 和零散 AI 工具，绕开正式采购：&quot;Teams put model APIs or point AI tools on a card to move quickly, bypassing the formal pur…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Shadow AI Spend What It Costs and How to Control It Supla#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button>。这是真的&quot;采购绕过&quot;，但只有一个来源、而且是小额刷卡的窄场景，推不翻&quot;终端准入在 IT&quot;。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">多数 AI 支出由业务部门审批：&quot;Eighty percent of enterprise AI spend is now approved and managed at the business unit lev…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[BCG Finds 80 Percent of Enterprise AI Spending Happens Outsi#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>。它说的是&quot;支出审批&quot;，不是&quot;终端准入&quot;，所以让 H1 收窄、但没推翻；它对 H3 的影响更大。</li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">推导（推断）：支持证据只证明了两件事——IT 有管理机队的工具，员工绕过的是企业定的规则。这足以支持&quot;准入权在 IT&quot;，但不足以支持&quot;员工端 AI 的采购全部由 IT 发起&quot;：采购公告、招标文件、企业 AI 使用规定原文都没有找到，而反证指向部门自采确实存在。所以 H1 只在&quot;准入&quot;这一层成立，判&quot;需要修正&quot;。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">So what 的候选：联想的销售入口仍然是 IT 的准入清单，材料要按部署方式、SSO、日志字段、策略下发来组织；员工喜不喜欢只是采用条件，不是中标理由。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口，以及要问专家的问题：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：没有企业终端 / AI 使用管理规定的原文条款。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：没有员工端 AI 工具的采购公告或招标文件，统计不了决策方。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：员工端 AI 工具通常由谁发起采购、谁签字、谁做安全评审？</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：IT 是发起方还是否决方？</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：业务部门刷卡买的 AI 订阅，IT 一般通过什么发现、发现后怎么处理？</li></ul></li></ul><h3 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-3 text-base font-semibold">H2 可管理性是采购的必要条件，不是加分项　<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>WS-A-H2 可管理性是采购必要条件而非溢价</span></h3><ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">提议的判断：需要修正</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">修正后的假设：安全与治理是员工端 AI <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">部署和规模化的强约束</strong>——它在实际推迟上线、收窄部署范围，部分行业已经把它写成供应商准入条件；但证据不足以说明&quot;集中配置、权限边界、审计追责&quot;三层被普遍写成&quot;不过就出局&quot;的资格条款，也没有看到&quot;AI 更强但管不住的产品被淘汰&quot;的取舍结果。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">支持的证据：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">CIO 把安全与风险排在扩大 AI 的头号障碍：&quot;Indeed, 77% of more than 11,000 CIOs in Gartner&#x27;s 1H26 CIO Report said security and risk w…&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[InformationWeek 2026-06 安全在拖慢自主AI#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">不只是态度，而是已发生的结果：多数组织的 AI 项目因安全或合规评审在上线前被推迟：&quot;The report, produced by Enterprise Management Associates and based on a survey of IT and s…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Enterprise AI deployments slowed by security reviews#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>；并以缩减的形态部署：&quot;It also found that 81.6% had deployed AI in a reduced form because of security concerns, i…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Enterprise AI deployments slowed by security reviews#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">安全被当成每份方案的前提，而不是附加项：&quot;88% of business and IT leaders said they expected security to be included in every proposa…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级，戴尔委托调研）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[SecurityBrief 2026-10 戴尔调研称安全拖慢EMEA AI落地#^c5]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c5</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">一个把安全资质写成准入条件的制度实例：&quot;某城商行2025年实施的AI服务商白名单制度要求：服务商需通过ISO/IEC27001认证、提供源代码托管权限、接受季度渗透测试。&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[人工智能在金融领域的2025年法规解读与风险管理可行性分析报告.docx - 建立供应商“准入-监控-退出”全流程管控#^c6]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c6</span></button></li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">反证：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">员工为了速度愿意冒安全风险：&quot;60% say speed is worth the security risk;&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[CIO.com 2026-01 BlackFog影子AI调查#^c4]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c4</span></button>。调查对象是员工、不是采购决策方，说明的是使用层面的取舍，推不翻企业采购的门槛。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">厂商自己的页面把实施复杂度和前期成本列为采用障碍：&quot;Sin embargo, la complejidad de la implementación, los altos costes iniciales y los modelos…&quot;（A 级，知识库，厂商立场）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[联想 TruScale DaaS for AI PCs 页面#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button>。这是另一类障碍，和&quot;可管理性是必要条件&quot;不冲突，也没做排序比较。</li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">推导（推断）：一条 B 级加上多条互相独立的 C 级来源，足以否定&quot;可管理性只是加分项&quot;。但原论点有三处说得比证据满：①&quot;一票否决&quot;只在一个行业的一份制度里出现；②三层能力没有逐项对应到任何采购条款；③看到的是&quot;推迟和缩减&quot;，没看到&quot;在 AI 能力和可管理性之间二选一&quot;的淘汰结果。所以判&quot;需要修正&quot;。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">So what 的候选：可管理性要按&quot;能被写成资格条款的证明物&quot;来准备（认证、审计日志导出、策略下发和权限边界的能力清单），用来保住进门资格；不宜把它当作溢价来源。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口，以及要问专家的问题：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：没有采购文件层面的原文，看不出管理能力写在资格条款还是评分表、权重多少。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：没有&quot;AI 更强但不可管而被否&quot;的案例。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：终端设备管理能力在你们的招标里是资格条款还是评分项？</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：过去一年有没有&quot;AI 能力更强但管控不达标&quot;的方案被否决或只允许小范围试点？</li></ul></li></ul><h3 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-3 text-base font-semibold">H3 增量预算落在软件 / 安全 / 管理服务科目，硬件拿不到 AI 溢价　<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>WS-A-H3 增量预算落在软件与服务科目</span></h3><ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">提议的判断：需要修正</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">修正后的假设：<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">硬件侧</strong>，买方把 AI 能力当成换机顺带的默认配置，AI 没有被单独定价，也不是付费理由——这一半成立。<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">软件和服务侧</strong>，只查得到按席位、按用量的计费方式和付费规模的迹象，查不到这些钱在企业预算里记在哪个科目、由谁出；而且有迹象表明很大一部分 AI 支出由业务部门审批，不在 IT 的软件预算里。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">支持的证据：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">带 AI 能力的 PC 是&quot;默认配置&quot;而不是主动选择：&quot;The growth in the volume of PCs that have been bought with AI capabilities has been more b…&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[ComputerWeekly 2025-10 Omdia称Win11才是换机主因#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">换机潮由商用大客户带动，主因是停服换机：&quot;The initial surge was led by commercial enterprise users, accounting for roughly 74% of 20…&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Futurum 2025-12 AI PC采用不会加速#^c3]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c3</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">软件侧确有按席位付费的规模：&quot;Microsoft officials said there are now 20 million paid Microsoft 365 Copilot seats (up fro…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Microsoft&#x27;s Q3 FY26 Take-Aways Consumption Pricing Is Comin#^c4]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c4</span></button>；也有按用量计费的单位：&quot;A GitHub AI Credit is one cent of AI usage.&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[GitHub Copilot Enterprise pricing 2026 seats, AI credits,#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">联想也有把设备和服务打包成订阅的形态，但没有买家规模和科目信息：&quot;Simplify AI PC adoption, boost productivity, and maximize ROI with next-gen devices and ex…&quot;（A 级，知识库，厂商立场）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[联想 TruScale DaaS for AI PCs 页面#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button></li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">反证：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">HP 台数降、收入升，单机收入在涨：&quot;米Wall Street Journal（WSJ）によると、HPは4〜6月期のPC部門で出荷台数が前年同期比16%減少した一方、売上高は18%増加した。&quot;（C 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[DigitalToday 2026-09 AI PC推高单价#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>。这推翻了&quot;硬件整体拿不到溢价&quot;，但没拆出是 AI 带来的还是内存涨价和高端化带来的，所以推不翻&quot;AI 能力不单独定价&quot;（推断：同期内存涨价是更直接的解释，见 H4）。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">多数 AI 支出由业务部门审批：&quot;Eighty percent of enterprise AI spend is now approved and managed at the business unit lev…&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[BCG Finds 80 Percent of Enterprise AI Spending Happens Outsi#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>。如果属实，&quot;钱在 IT 的软件席位科目&quot;只是一部分，变现路径要重新看。</li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">推导（推断）：硬件那一半有两家独立研究机构的 B 级买方归因证据，成立；软件 / 服务那一半只有 C 级的计费单元证据，没有任何科目归属证据，还有一条 C 级反证指向钱在 IT 之外。只支持一部分，判&quot;需要修正&quot;。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">So what 的候选：押管理栈要变现，必须先做出能归到具体科目的订阅 / 服务产品和报价口径，并弄清楚买单的是 IT 还是业务部门；在这之前，&quot;增量靠服务和席位变现&quot;只能算推断。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口，以及要问专家的问题：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：没有 A/B 级的预算科目归属调研。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：没有同代同配置机型的买方价格对比。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：软件侧的计费和席位数据全是 C 级。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：员工端 AI 新增的钱实际记在哪个成本中心？</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：AI 能力在采购配置单上是否单独列价？</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：业务部门自己批的 AI 支出，和 IT 的终端预算是什么关系？</li></ul></li></ul><h3 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-3 text-base font-semibold">H4 换机预算吃紧时，&quot;AI&quot;标签不扩大预算，只批能证明价值的支出　<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>WS-A-H4 换机预算吃紧只批可证明价值</span></h3><ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">提议的判断：需要修正</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">修正后的假设：内存和存储涨价已经推高整机价格、压低出货，&quot;AI PC&quot;这个标签本身拉不动预算——这一半成立。但&quot;AI 支出必须先证明回报才获批&quot;有正反两面：一部分决策者要求很快见到回报，同时整体 AI 支出在回报不清的情况下仍在增长；终端预算具体怎么批，没有证据。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">支持的证据：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">内存涨价推高价格、压低出货：&quot;Soaring memory costs are projected to drive worldwide PC shipments to decline 10.4% and sm…&quot;（B 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Gartner 2026-02 内存涨价压低出货#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button>；实际出货也在收缩：&quot;市場研究機構IDC指出，2026年第三季全球PC出貨量6,270萬台，比去年同期的7,850萬台衰退20.1%，是自2023年第一季以來最大的單季年減幅。&quot;（B 级，知识库，转引 IDC）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[数位时代 2026-10 AI换机潮落空#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">CIO 调查显示 AI 热情没有转化成 IT 预算增长：&quot;the bank’s latest Chief Information Officer survey shows AI excitement is not translating …&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[Investing.com 2026-01 摩根士丹利CIO调查AI未抬高IT预算#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要求快速见回报的决策者不少：&quot;45 percent of AI decision-makers need positive ROI within a year to consider their investments successful.&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级，转述 Forrester）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[AI will eat a fifth of tech budgets in 2027, but don&#x27;t expec#^c1]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c1</span></button></li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">反证：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">同一篇报道说，即便回报不清，AI 支出也会继续增长：&quot;The money will keep flowing through IT budgets regardless.&quot;（C 级，网络 · AI 定级，转述 Forrester）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[AI will eat a fifth of tech budgets in 2027, but don&#x27;t expec#^c5]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c5</span></button>。<strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">v1 把这句读成&quot;资金照常经 IT 预算流入、不需要证明回报&quot;并当作主要反证；结合上下文，它说的是 AI 总支出不会因为回报弱而停，并不说明终端预算怎么审批。</strong> 它削弱了&quot;必须先证明回报才批&quot;的强版本，所以 H4 后半句不能写成结论。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">HP 预期 AI PC 占比继续上升：&quot;And we are expecting it to get up to 60% to 70% in 2027 and more than 70% in 2028.&quot;（A 级，知识库，厂商立场）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[HP 2026-08 FY26Q3 财报电话会#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button>。这是出货结构，不是预算扩大；按 W1 的决定（<span class="border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 align-middle text-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>W1决定-AI PC渗透不作为付费意愿证据</span>），不能把 AI PC 渗透当付费意愿证据。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">IDC 把三季度下滑部分归因于上半年提前备货：&quot;IDC attributes the drop to inventory front-loading in H1 2026, when vendors stocked up ahe…&quot;（C 级，知识库）<button type="button" data-testid="citation-chip" data-link="[[KitGuru 2026-10 IDC三季度出货#^c2]]" aria-pressed="false" title="没有找到这条引用的详情" class="mx-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle text-[11px] leading-none transition-colors focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border bg-muted/60 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono">^c2</span></button>。这削弱&quot;单季下滑就是需求收缩&quot;的读法，但不否定涨价传到价格这条因果链。</li></ul></li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">推导（推断）：前半句有 Gartner 和 IDC 两个独立来源支持，成立；后半句的正反证据都是 C 级、来自同一篇转述，而且都不是针对终端预算的。只支持一部分，判&quot;需要修正&quot;。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">So what 的候选：在涨价的两年里，卖 AI 相关能力要带着能算出来的账（安全事件、处置工时、运维人力），而不是&quot;AI PC&quot;标签；这个账要由卖方提供。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口，以及要问专家的问题：<ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col text-sm leading-6 mt-1 gap-0.5 pl-4"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：没有 CIO 降本压力具体落到终端预算的证据。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：分不清企业是延长换机周期、降配置还是照常换。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">缺口：没有&quot;因可量化收益而单独获批&quot;的案例。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：涨价之后你们实际是延长换机周期、下调配置，还是照常换？</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：AI 能力在终端选型里是资格项、加分项还是不计分？</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">要问专家：有没有某项终端 AI 或安全能力因为能拿出量化收益而单独获批？</li></ul></li></ul><h2 class="text-foreground scroll-mt-4 mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">对 workplan 的影响</h2><ul class="text-foreground/90 flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6"><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">四条假设都按&quot;修正后的假设&quot;改写，等 Senior 在结论审批里拍板；开工前那句答案的前半句（可管理是入场券、硬件 AI 拿不到溢价）基本站住，后半句（钱从软件 / 服务预算出）没有证实，要改成待验证。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">新冒出来的问题要单列：AI 的钱可能大部分在业务部门手里。这会改变&quot;押管理栈怎么变现&quot;的判断，建议在结论审批时和 Senior 对齐，并作为第三枝&quot;价值被谁拿走&quot;的输入。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">追加调查：员工端 AI 的采购决策方、招标资格条款和预算科目归属，这三块公开资料补不上，优先排专家访谈。</li><li class="marker:text-muted-foreground">和第五枝&quot;三层押注的评估&quot;的重叠处（交 Senior 裁）：本报告给出的&quot;不要把 AI / NPU 当商用加价理由&quot;&quot;管理栈用来保份额而不是定价&quot;，已经接近下注层面的建议。</li></ul></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" data-slot="separator" class="bg-border shrink-0 data-[orientation=horizontal]:h-px data-[orientation=horizontal]:w-full data-[orientation=vertical]:w-px data-[orientation=vertical]:self-stretch my-6"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button data-slot="button" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 border bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-[3px] [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none group/button select-none border-border bg-background hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground shadow-xs h-8 gap-1 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),10px)] px-2.5 in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-md has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5" type="button" disabled="">追加调查</button><button data-slot="button" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 border bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-[3px] [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none group/button select-none border-border bg-background hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground shadow-xs h-8 gap-1 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),10px)] px-2.5 in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-md has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5" type="button" disabled="">调整方向</button><button data-slot="button" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 border bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-[3px] [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none group/button select-none border-border bg-background hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground shadow-xs h-8 gap-1 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),10px)] px-2.5 in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-md has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5" type="button" disabled="">重新调查</button><button data-slot="button" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 border bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-[3px] [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none group/button select-none border-border bg-background hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground shadow-xs h-8 gap-1 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),10px)] px-2.5 in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-md has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5" type="button" disabled="">新建调查</button><button data-slot="button" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 border bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-[3px] [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none group/button select-none border-border bg-background hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground shadow-xs h-8 gap-1 rounded-[min(var(--radius-md),10px)] px-2.5 in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-md has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5" type="button" disabled="">直接 fix 当前版本</button><span class="text-muted-foreground text-xs">演示版本只展示入口</span></div></div><aside class="bg-background sticky bottom-0 z-10 order-last w-full @3xl:top-4 @3xl:bottom-auto @3xl:order-none @3xl:w-[360px] @3xl:shrink-0 hidden @3xl:block"><div class="border-border bg-card rounded-lg border"><div class="border-border flex items-center gap-2 border-b px-3 py-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote text-muted-foreground size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-medium">引用详情</span></div><div data-testid="cite-scroll" class="max-h-[min(40vh,18rem)] overflow-y-auto @3xl:max-h-[min(70vh,32rem)]"><div class="px-3 py-3"><div class="border-border flex min-h-40 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-dashed px-4 py-8 text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote text-muted-foreground size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">点击报告里的引用，在这里查看资料原文</p></div></div></div></div></aside></div></div></div>"`;
